# .forceignore
# Exclude metadata that should not be retrieved or deployed from this repository.
# Uses .gitignore syntax. Applied by `sf project retrieve/deploy` commands.
# See: https://developer.salesforce.com/docs/atlas.en-us.sfdx_dev.meta/sfdx_dev/sfdx_dev_exclude_source.htm

# =============================================================================
# Managed Packages
# Add prefixes for installed managed packages. Their metadata is read-only and
# should not be version-controlled or deployed from this repository.
# =============================================================================

# Example: Pardot / Account Engagement
# **/pi__*

# Example: Salesforce DevOps Center
# **/sf_devops__*

# =============================================================================
# Org-specific noise (uncomment or add as needed)
# =============================================================================

# Installed package definitions (managed externally, not deployable)
# **/installedPackages
